My GPSr: N53 43.086 W114 53.65[b]8[/b]

My Elevation: 745 m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find this one involved a very pleasant drive along quiet country roads, some of them even winding, so that's a bonus.  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I was able to locate the cap quickly and be on my way south along roads I've never travelled before. After all, that's the point of this whole thing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

